      "how_satisfied": "The Retention Enforcer permanently deletes records and payloads, using partition-level purge, once they pass the Lifecycle Policy deletion horizon measured from the service-assigned received-at. The Retrieval Service filters out records past that horizon so they cannot be retrieved. With a horizon of seven days, this satisfies the Requirement in isolation.",
