      "how_satisfied": "The Ingestion Service durably persists immutable records and payloads. The Retrieval Service returns them unchanged. The Lifecycle Policy availability window, validated so that it is never longer than the deletion horizon, keeps records retrievable for at least the window. With a window of ninety days, this satisfies the Requirement in isolation.",
